= Juan Negrín

Negrín is a physiologist by training, a professor at the University of Madrid, who has turned his precise, technical mind to questions of economics and public finance. Pragmatic and undogmatic, he is trusted across the party's currents as an honest broker on the hard numbers.

- @against_right_and_left
- @toleration
- @finance_ministry_
- @economic_democracy_
- @root: Return to main

@against_right_and_left
title: Against Right and Left
subtitle: Negrín seeks to steer a technical course between the party's warring factions.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 5; advisor_action_time = time; center_strength += 10; left_strength -= 5; labor_strength -= 5; neorevisionist_strength -= 5; center_dissent -= 10

We have reduced the strength of the dissident factions in the party.

@toleration
title: Defending Toleration
subtitle: Negrín supports supporting the government from outside rather than joining it.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_toleration: The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not tolerating a government. ?]
choose-if: psoe_in_government = 0 and psoe_toleration = 1 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 5

We have reduced dissent among the factions that chafe at supporting a government we do not lead.

@finance_ministry_
title: Fiscal Policy
subtitle: With Prieto at the Finance Ministry, Negrín can help shape tax and budget policy.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if psoe_in_government = 0 : <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> not in government. ?] [? if finance_minister_party != "PSOE" : The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> does not hold the Finance Ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and psoe_in_government == 1 and finance_minister_party == "PSOE"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; fiscal_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: fiscal_policy

@economic_democracy_
title: Economic Democracy
subtitle: Enact policies to build a more democratic economy.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if psoe_in_government = 0 : <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> not in government. ?] [? if labor_minister_party != "PSOE" or (finance_minister_party != "PSOE" and economic_minister_party != "PSOE") : We do not hold the necessary ministries. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and psoe_in_government == 1 and (economic_minister_party == "PSOE" or finance_minister_party == "PSOE") and (labor_minister_party == "PSOE")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; economic_democracy_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: economic_democracy
